sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Customer
  participant P as Pay page
  participant N as NEAR (USDC contract)
  participant W as Tegata worker
  participant B as Business
  C->>P: opens the invoice or pay link
  P->>P: starts an attempt, memo tegata:pay:<id>
  alt Tegata balance
    C->>P: approves (email sign-in key signs)
    P->>W: signed action
    W->>N: relays it, Tegata pays the fee
  else NEAR wallet
    C->>N: ft_transfer(business, amount, memo)
    P->>W: transaction hash
  end
  W->>N: reads the transaction when final
  N-->>W: USDC event: to business, amount, memo
  W->>W: matches all three, marks paid, numbers the receipt
  W-->>B: Paid, with the PAID seal and the NEAR link
